        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Marcus Aurelius, Antoninus Pius\n- Monuments: The Great Antonine Altar\n- Roles: Roman co-emperors\n- Topics: Nerva-Antonine dynasty\n\nFacts:\n- Marcus Aurelius was an adoptive brother in the Nerva-Antonine dynasty.\n- Marcus Aurelius and the person to the right of Antoninus Pius on The Great Antonine Altar were co-emperors of Rome.\n- The co-emperorship took place during the Nerva-Antonine dynasty in the 1800s.",
